### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api/v1
@recruiterToken = YOUR_RECRUITER_JWT_HERE
@candidateToken = YOUR_CANDIDATE_JWT_HERE

### 1. List All Jobs (Public, Filterable, Paginated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/jobs?page=1&limit=10&keyword=Engineer
Accept: application/json

### 2. Create Job Post (Recruiter only)
# @name createJob
POST {{baseUrl}}/jobs
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{recruiterToken}}

{
  "title": "Senior Cloud Infrastructure Engineer",
  "company": "Nexus Distributed Systems",
  "description": "Architecting resilient microservices, Kubernetes clusters, and automated CI pipelines with high availability.",
  "location": "Berlin, Germany / Remote",
  "type": "full-time",
  "salary": 95000,
  "totalSlots": 3,
  "requirements": ["Node.js", "Docker", "Kubernetes", "MongoDB", "CI/CD"]
}

### Capture Created Job ID
@jobId = {{createJob.response.body.job._id}}

### 3. Get Job by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/jobs/{{jobId}}
Accept: application/json

### 4. Toggle Save/Bookmark Job
POST {{baseUrl}}/jobs/{{jobId}}/save
Authorization: Bearer {{candidateToken}}

### 5. Get Saved Jobs
GET {{baseUrl}}/jobs/saved
Authorization: Bearer {{candidateToken}}

### 6. Get AI-Powered Recommended Jobs
GET {{baseUrl}}/jobs/recommended
Authorization: Bearer {{candidateToken}}
